  <item>
    <title>E104:器乐专题｜超乎想象的电吉他Music歌单</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a3e68a02e335a35a809df18</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a3e68a02e335a35a809df18</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 27 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期节目推荐大家佩戴耳机收听🎧</span></strong></p><p><span>提到电吉他，可能大家的第一反应就是带有强劲失真音色的摇滚乐，但今天的节目当中，你会听到更多风格的作品，乡村的、流行的、爵士的等等等等，很有趣的是在这些歌曲背后，他们使用的是同一把琴——</span><strong><span>Fender Telecaster</span></strong></p><p><span>这是全球⾸款量产实⼼电吉他、同时也是史上最具影响⼒的乐器之⼀，今年是</span><strong><span>Telecaster75周年，</span></strong><span>这75年间，在乡村、硬摇滚、流行、独立、另类等各种音乐的发展中，telcaster都贡献了难以磨灭的声音。</span><br></p><p><span>在我们今天这期节目你将听到4种不同情绪氛围的音乐，在旷野的公路上、温柔的心跳里、叛逆的倾诉中和释然的自由，时间横跨几十年，希望在今天这期节目之后，你可以对电吉他这种乐器有更全面的想象。</span><br></p><p><strong><span>【野声宝库视频版】目前在BliBli独家更新，大家可以搜索「阿野Ayer」关注哦～</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft1UKGjZSFbwC0z768J2TYmMYmqo.jpg"><p></p><h2><strong><span>本期歌单内容：</span></strong></h2><h2><span>开场曲</span></h2><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="12">00:12</a></span></strong><strong><span>《Good Times Bad Times》Led Zeppelin（1969）</span></strong></p><p></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="265">04:25</a></span></strong><strong><span>《Chattahoochee》Alan Jackson（1993）</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljBAd2ZbG5i5j3PAEOEZPrs5B6Ic.png"><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="489">08:09</a></span></strong><strong><span>《Born to Run》Bruce Springsteen(1975)</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpU-FAlM8bTG0LaHVlPw-PnnHyKd.jpg"><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="858">14:18</a></span></strong><strong><span>《Let's Make Sure We Kiss Goodbye》Vince Gill （2000）</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fif3UCv77v5O_tgw6ODPaS7G-bNW.png"><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1205">20:05</a></span></strong><strong><span>《Another Half》Julian Lage（2023）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1477">24:37</a></span></strong><strong><span>《Refugee》Tom Petty &amp; the Heartbreakers（1979）</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lj73M3RzlK6C6AEOr7LyEh1oG7UU.png"><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1791">29:51</a></span></strong><strong><span>《London Calling》The Clash (1979)</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ltODNbUCDRr7_G2m_v_hql1q7HjY.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr0g0jmXpv4FV43zFqBBJz8yKLv8.png"><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2091">34:51</a></span></strong><strong><span>《If It Makes You Happy》Sheryl Crow（1996）</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtcHMlA-ueC3zK-m3bN_N38n19wJ.png"><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2532">42:12</a></span></strong><strong><span>《Today》Brad Paisley（2016）</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lj3Nu_r_yx6EQKV6MfWHUrpVvYZa.jpg"><p></p><h2><strong><span>结尾曲</span></strong></h2><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2832">47:12</a></span></strong><strong><span>《Hallelujah》Jeff Buckley（1994）</span></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong><span>🎧 关于「野声宝库」</span></strong></p><p><span>野声宝库是一档以挖掘各种风格的现代流行音乐为主题的音乐文化分享类播客</span></p><p><span>合作：AyerPodcasts</span></p>]]></description>
